<title>POLAND: Espebepe Q1 net turns to PLN 2.6 mln los.</title>
<headline>Espebepe Q1 net turns to PLN 2.6 mln los.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Espebepe preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			   2.48 vs	1.39 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     2.62 vs	0.05 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				   2.63 vs	0.05</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Espebepe SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 22.22 vs     17.86</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  21.55 vs     14.66</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.12 vs     25.13</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.26 vs     26.47</p>
<p>    investment				 0.18 vs	 na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
